{{:Header/Farming}}

The Apothecary is used to brew potions with permanent game bonuses using resources generated from [[Tilling]] and [[Botany]]. [[Ascension]] does not reset or change any aspect in Apothecary, but [[Rebirth]]ing will only reset Apothecary level. Potions already crafted remain, and can continue to be crafted if they've been crafted beyond level 1.

==Cauldrons==
Cauldrons are the upgradeable "skillers" of Apothecary, which are used to discover and brew potions. Potion ([[File:Potionexp_icon.png|14px]]) is increased by upgrading Value, and the rate of effect ([[File:Potionspeed_icon.png|14px]]) is increased by upgrading Speed. The Apothecary EXP multiplier ([[File:Potionmulti_icon.png|14px]]) is always constant per Cauldron, but increases based on each individual Cauldron position. Apothecary EXP is only generated when Cauldrons are active.

One free Cauldron is provided at the start, but up to 5 additional Cauldrons can be unlocked after reaching a designated H2O level and they're purchased with gold.

