===Potion Coupons===
The [[Gem Shop]] features five types of potion scrolls which can be used to automatically discover and level up a random potion. These coupons are simply clicked on the Apothecary screen in order to use them. Potions discovered using coupons can always be crafted, bypassing the level requirement.

